            title: 'Tribello',
            subtitle: 'Card Game',
            content: [
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Tribello is a 3-player trick-taking game from Illinois, USA with 4 distinct rounds over 12 deals. Each round changes the trump rules and objectives: Round 1 (cut trump), Round 2 (dealer picks trump), Round 3 (no trump), Round 4 (Nullo â€” avoid tricks). Players have positional trick quotas and score +/- based on performance vs quota.',
              },
              {
                type: 'paragraph',
                text: 'Tribello is a regional American trick-taking game from Illinois, USA. It was contributed by Mary Beale, whose family from DeKalb County have played it since the 1930s or 1940s. The game is a whist-type quota game with four distinct rounds (cut trump, dealer names trump, no trump, and nullo).',
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            title: 'Setup',
            subtitle: 'Table, deck, equipment, and deal',
